WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:04.060
Changes are needed, yes,  but let's not change the essence.

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:08.800
And the essence is that Europe is a project of peace and project for the future.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.150
That's what I am committed to and I commit to this before you today.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:20.230
I am not tired, I am not sick as newspapers in Germany write... Apparently

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:21.640
doctors are becoming journalists nowadays.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:29.279
I am what I am – to my last breath I will fight for united Europe.

